WEBVTT

00:06.460 --> 00:08.080
He actually showed up.

00:10.040 --> 00:13.920
Hey, we said you had to give five more in exchange!

00:15.080 --> 00:16.380
I'm the fifth one.

00:16.710 --> 00:19.040
Hurry up and give back those two kids you snatched!

00:21.250 --> 00:24.750
We only take the people of this country as merchandise!

00:24.750 --> 00:27.040
Bastards like you aren't fit for sale.

00:27.040 --> 00:28.830
I'm a special ability user.

00:38.500 --> 00:41.710
That'll do it! We almost missed out
on some high-quality merch!

00:42.580 --> 00:46.130
So the deal's been done, right?
Give back those kids, now.

00:53.540 --> 00:59.630
You idiot. We'd never return the merchandise
we worked so hard to get!

01:01.960 --> 01:05.080
Didn't expect to get five more at once today, though!

01:08.250 --> 01:11.380
At this rate, we'll be able to open a market in no time.

03:03.210 --> 03:07.960
<b>"The Coldhearted Princess Sneaks In"</b>

03:04.080 --> 03:06.330
We're going to the den of the
human trafficking organization?!

03:06.960 --> 03:07.710
Yes.

03:08.210 --> 03:12.670
We'll become the replacement hostages
and infiltrate the enemy's headquarters.

03:13.040 --> 03:19.250
After protecting those imprisoned, the knights
will rush in and round up all the criminals.

03:19.960 --> 03:23.880
I've already told Her Majesty a summary of the incident,

03:24.170 --> 03:27.830
and she has given orders to save the people
and exterminate the organization.

03:28.250 --> 03:29.330
Has she?

03:30.330 --> 03:34.460
I did not hear her say that we should
not proceed to do so ourselves.

03:34.960 --> 03:36.330
Well, but...

03:36.330 --> 03:43.460
Me aside, Princess Pride of royal blood, Stale, and you
too, Chancellor Gilbert... their guys know your faces.

03:43.460 --> 03:46.330
That's true. So we'll become different people.

03:46.790 --> 03:47.830
Different people?

03:51.630 --> 03:52.790
Please, pardon me.

04:01.000 --> 04:01.830
Ah!

04:02.290 --> 04:02.960
Huh?!

04:03.250 --> 04:03.960
What?!

04:07.710 --> 04:12.040
Now if we put on the clothes of commonfolk, we should
be able to see the children who were kidnapped.

04:12.500 --> 04:13.960
Of course, I'll be there too.

04:17.080 --> 04:20.670
Chancellor Gilbert's special ability, Age Manipulation!

04:21.330 --> 04:24.080
I can't believe this is where I meet game Gil!

04:25.580 --> 04:29.960
We will act like we don't know one another and
use different names when addressing each other.

04:30.250 --> 04:31.750
I'll be "Philip."

04:32.210 --> 04:33.670
Gilbert is "Gil."

04:33.960 --> 04:35.790
And Elder sister will be...

04:36.790 --> 04:38.880
Are you okay, Jeanne?

04:40.080 --> 04:42.170
Yes. Thanks, Philip.

04:45.540 --> 04:47.250
It seems we've arrived.

04:51.630 --> 04:54.710
There seems to be no mistake;
we are at their headquarters.

04:55.380 --> 04:56.580
Well then, let's start.

05:04.210 --> 05:04.960
Huh?

05:05.750 --> 05:09.540
Hey, who told you damn brats to undo the ropes?!

05:10.960 --> 05:13.170
If you're not a good little boy
you're gonna get hur...

05:14.540 --> 05:15.960
H-huh?

05:18.830 --> 05:19.710
Idiots.

05:20.420 --> 05:22.920
Iron bars?! Where'd those kids go?!

05:23.330 --> 05:24.210
You made it.

05:25.830 --> 05:28.330
It's just as Chancellor Gilbert says.

05:28.670 --> 05:32.250
You mean we can go ahead and find out
from these guys where the enemy base is?

05:42.830 --> 05:45.630
Everything's all right now. You don't have to worry.

05:52.880 --> 05:56.210
Stand up. We're going to save Kemet and Sefec.

05:56.750 --> 05:59.330
Elder Sister, I'll be right back.

05:59.960 --> 06:01.960
Please, be very careful out here.

06:01.960 --> 06:04.210
I will, and you do the same.

06:05.210 --> 06:08.790
If you need anything, call for me.
We'll use that signal we talked about.

06:10.790 --> 06:15.040
All the people who are called "middle-grade"
are being kept close to the entry,

06:15.460 --> 06:19.580
and the special ability users...
the "high-grade" are being kept in the back.

06:20.080 --> 06:21.130
Is that correct?

06:21.500 --> 06:22.580
Probably.

06:23.080 --> 06:26.790
Low lives all think alike, no matter where they're from.

06:27.000 --> 06:28.670
Okay... Let's go.

06:33.250 --> 06:35.960
Damn, it's been rough today!

06:36.290 --> 06:39.130
On top of the merchandise disappearing all at once,

06:39.130 --> 06:43.290
all the kids left behind are just middle-grade merch
who aren't special ability users!

06:44.330 --> 06:49.880
And the guards weren't there either.
Did those guys steal the merch?

06:52.130 --> 06:54.750
Get in there and keep it quiet.

06:55.540 --> 06:56.290
Go!

07:00.500 --> 07:01.500
Are you all right?

07:01.880 --> 07:02.880
Any injuries?

07:04.080 --> 07:06.130
I'm fine, thanks.

07:09.540 --> 07:11.880
This is the cell for the middle-grades...

07:13.830 --> 07:14.710
Val...

07:22.080 --> 07:24.580
Could those kids be...

07:26.420 --> 07:27.960
Kemet and Sefec?

07:29.080 --> 07:29.830
Who are you?

07:30.080 --> 07:32.540
Oh, um, we're...

07:32.880 --> 07:35.080
Did you, maybe... talk to Val?

07:35.960 --> 07:37.750
Were you brought here by Val?!

07:38.380 --> 07:39.790
Yes, that's right...

07:40.040 --> 07:42.630
We're friends of Val's.

07:42.630 --> 07:44.830
No way Val would ever have friends!

07:45.380 --> 07:48.630
You don't have to hide anything from us.
Val got caught, didn't he?

07:49.040 --> 07:52.380
They would never give us back for that...

07:52.830 --> 07:54.330
He's really stupid!

07:55.330 --> 07:58.330
Wow, she's really going in on Val.

07:59.920 --> 08:01.040
I'm so sorry.

08:01.250 --> 08:06.040
You were fooled into saving us.
I'm really sorry about this.

08:06.580 --> 08:09.380
Where's Val?

08:09.920 --> 08:11.000
Oh, that's right!

08:11.290 --> 08:15.420
Not that I want to remember a guy
like that but please! Where is Val?!

08:15.540 --> 08:19.210
Is he in town? Were you captured together?
C'mon, tell me!

08:19.540 --> 08:21.750
Calm down, everything is okay.

08:21.750 --> 08:25.670
By now, he's gone to the higher-grade cells to find you...

08:25.830 --> 08:27.630
Then he really did get captured!

08:28.630 --> 08:31.500
Brats over there! Shut up!

08:33.880 --> 08:36.170
It's all right, you can go back to your country.

08:38.630 --> 08:42.880
Is this everyone? I took care of
all the special ability users, but...

08:43.250 --> 08:45.080
seems like Kemet and Sefec weren't there.

08:45.380 --> 08:49.170
Those little brats! They're freaking
hiding that they have special abilities!

08:50.540 --> 08:54.920
Even if they are, that means they're with Elder Sister
in the sub-middle-grade cell.

08:55.420 --> 08:56.710
There's no real problem there.

08:57.210 --> 08:59.500
Hey, what's that down there?

09:00.460 --> 09:02.330
The special cell, probably.

09:02.790 --> 09:03.710
Special?

09:04.040 --> 09:06.000
For a unique special ability user.

09:06.290 --> 09:08.380
If they catch 'em, that is.

09:10.580 --> 09:13.080
What're you two doing here?!

09:13.420 --> 09:15.580
Where'd all the high-grade ones go?!

09:21.920 --> 09:24.380
The knights should also be arriving soon.

09:25.630 --> 09:26.920
We're nearing the finish line.

09:28.170 --> 09:30.630
I'm going to go check the special cell now.

09:31.330 --> 09:37.630
This is an order. While I'm gone, make a big ruckus
and lure the organization's lackeys here.

09:38.540 --> 09:41.790
I'll allow a limited amount of vandalism. Got that?

09:42.380 --> 09:45.330
As you wish, my prince.

09:50.130 --> 09:52.080
I told you to keep it quiet!

09:52.460 --> 09:55.540
I'm gonna teach you want happens to brats that don't li-

09:55.790 --> 09:56.710
Whoa!

09:56.920 --> 09:57.880
The hell's that?!

09:58.580 --> 10:01.080
Whoa, what? What the hell?! The hell's going on?

10:09.460 --> 10:11.670
Get in here if you can, bastards!

10:13.250 --> 10:16.210
C'mon! If you keep dragging your feet,

10:16.210 --> 10:20.460
I'm gonna slaughter all the high-grade merchandise
you worked so hard to catch!

10:20.880 --> 10:23.250
Hey! There's an attack on the high-grade cells!

10:23.460 --> 10:25.750
What?! What are the guards doing?!

10:25.750 --> 10:29.170
There's the signal. The high-grade people
have been rescued, looks like.

10:29.540 --> 10:33.460
High grade! Val... Val is...!

10:36.380 --> 10:37.710
Whoa, hey!

10:39.040 --> 10:41.750
Have a seat, runt! Or else...

10:45.580 --> 10:46.250
Huh?

10:52.330 --> 10:53.500
What's this?

10:54.210 --> 10:58.920
If anything happens, she'll immediately use her ability
and knock 'em out with water at full blast.

11:00.130 --> 11:03.380
It's Sefec's special ability! But...

11:04.170 --> 11:06.000
The hell did that brat do?!

11:06.210 --> 11:07.630
Give us back Val!

11:13.500 --> 11:15.460
I had no idea she was so powerful!

11:16.540 --> 11:17.920
I will live.

11:18.290 --> 11:20.790
With Kemet and Val... the three of us, together!

11:23.130 --> 11:24.080
Wait!

11:24.250 --> 11:25.460
I'll take care of this one!

11:47.170 --> 11:49.080
Is... somebody there?

11:52.290 --> 11:53.750
I've come to save you.

11:59.500 --> 12:02.580
It's nice to meet you, I'm Philip.

12:03.580 --> 12:06.580
Uh... I'm Powell.

12:07.500 --> 12:10.540
It's okay now. You can go home.

12:12.710 --> 12:17.420
No! I won't go home... I'm not going!

12:19.290 --> 12:22.960
With this special ability... that I didn't even ask for!

12:23.580 --> 12:26.080
Powell! Where is it you won't go back to?

12:26.420 --> 12:28.540
If you don't like it there, you can escape to another place!

12:29.040 --> 12:30.750
You think I can really fit in anywhere?!

12:31.420 --> 12:33.710
I bring misery to whoever is near me!

12:34.040 --> 12:36.330
That's why I was cut off! From everything!

12:37.830 --> 12:40.290
And yet... What's wrong with it?!

12:40.880 --> 12:44.960
What's so wrong with wishing to simply continue living?!

12:50.380 --> 12:53.670
He can't control his ability, and it's going wild...

12:54.460 --> 12:57.670
Has he been ostracized and
become isolated because of this?

12:58.500 --> 13:01.670
What should I do? If it were Pride in this situation...

13:03.040 --> 13:06.210
she would definitely reach her hand out
to him without a second thought!

13:08.210 --> 13:12.580
Powell, you're going home to the Kingdom of Freesia!

13:13.170 --> 13:15.210
Stop it, stay away.

13:15.710 --> 13:18.210
I'm a special ability user too.

13:19.540 --> 13:20.960
That's why I can understand.

13:21.580 --> 13:26.000
Right now, you probably think
the Kingdom of Freesia is a difficult place to live.

13:26.920 --> 13:29.710
But, just wait a little longer.

13:30.500 --> 13:37.380
In a few years, I'm sure that Freesia will become
the easiest place to live in the world for you.

13:39.130 --> 13:40.750
How are you so sure about that?!

13:43.750 --> 13:47.710
The First Princess Pride is in the Kingdom of Freesia.

13:48.580 --> 13:52.710
When she becomes Queen, the country will change.

13:53.290 --> 13:55.750
It will be much better than it is now!

13:56.420 --> 13:57.420
I'm sure of it!

13:58.830 --> 14:06.630
The Kingdom of Freesia, our country,
is the place you'll go home to! It absolutely will be!

14:08.500 --> 14:09.630
Really?

14:10.130 --> 14:14.710
Wait in our country until Pride becomes queen, Powell!

14:15.250 --> 14:21.750
If by chance you lament that there
still isn't a place you belong, that's when...

14:26.790 --> 14:30.670
I will find a place for you!

14:35.130 --> 14:38.710
Why? Why would you do that for me?

14:39.580 --> 14:44.500
Because I understand.
And a hand reached out, just like this.

14:45.210 --> 14:47.460
I've also had someone do it for me.

14:49.000 --> 14:50.170
I promise you.

14:50.330 --> 14:58.630
No one will be hurt by special abilities, and
you and everyone you care about will be able to smile.

15:01.790 --> 15:04.420
I swear, for as long as I'm alive!

15:12.210 --> 15:16.420
I ended up using Pride's words...

15:20.130 --> 15:27.880
I have... to hurry... back to Pride...

15:39.960 --> 15:41.080
Over here!

15:41.080 --> 15:41.750
Hurry!

15:42.750 --> 15:44.710
Help the imprisoned!

15:44.710 --> 15:45.250
Yes, sir!

15:45.630 --> 15:46.630
They're knights!

15:46.630 --> 15:49.040
Knights came to save us!

15:52.040 --> 15:53.170
Arthur?!

15:53.880 --> 15:55.920
What're you doing here?!

15:56.250 --> 16:00.000
Pretty sure you're supposed to be with
Princess Pride in the Chancellor's residence...

16:00.000 --> 16:01.540
Er, well...

16:02.040 --> 16:04.790
Royal Knights! You came for us!

16:04.790 --> 16:06.420
Whoa, hide your face!

16:07.000 --> 16:07.670
Pri-

16:07.670 --> 16:12.130
Um, please rescue the people here!
Also, the enemy is back there!

16:12.460 --> 16:15.630
I'll lead the way, so back me up!

16:15.630 --> 16:16.290
Hey!

16:16.290 --> 16:16.920
Hang on there!

16:18.130 --> 16:20.540
Okay, Eric, you're in charge of this place!

16:20.540 --> 16:22.000
Eh? I am?!

16:23.170 --> 16:27.380
Half of you will guard everyone with Eric
and meet with the 3rd unit outside.

16:27.710 --> 16:31.630
The remaining half will subdue the enemy! Follow me!

16:32.330 --> 16:37.290
Arthur? Even if I don't hide my face,
I look like my 8-year-old self, so...

16:37.290 --> 16:40.580
No, they'll know it's you! Everyone's practically in lo...

16:40.580 --> 16:45.250
uh, well, in any case, be a little
more aware of the knight's eyes!

16:45.920 --> 16:47.210
Hey, Arthur!

16:49.250 --> 16:52.040
That child you're holding, I can't help
but think she looks like Pri-

16:52.040 --> 16:55.210
Her name's Jeanne! Jeanne!
She's the child of an acquaintance!

16:55.790 --> 16:57.880
Oh, an acquaintance, huh?

16:58.750 --> 17:02.380
Then let me hold little Jeanne too.

17:02.380 --> 17:03.670
Absolutely not!

17:03.670 --> 17:05.500
Why not? It's no big deal, right?

17:09.580 --> 17:12.920
This stupid brat was passed out in the special cell!

17:13.460 --> 17:15.960
Where's our precious cargo at?!

17:16.670 --> 17:17.580
Damn...

17:22.540 --> 17:24.710
Don't you lay a hand on him!

17:25.540 --> 17:30.330
If you are prepared to have your necks broken
then come at me all at once.

17:31.170 --> 17:36.330
Wait right there, if you want this guy to live!

17:36.750 --> 17:40.830
Heh. Like I'd ever be a hostage, you butterball.

17:41.540 --> 17:44.500
That will become your reality, unfortunately.

17:44.960 --> 17:51.210
If you die, Kemet and Sefec,
who I just left with the knights, will kill me.

17:53.080 --> 17:56.250
Knights?! Quit with the bluffing!

17:56.670 --> 18:01.080
What's this? Your face has changed colors...
Are you scared?

18:01.420 --> 18:03.960
The proud knights of our country are here.

18:05.130 --> 18:06.290
You bastard!

18:17.670 --> 18:19.920
Captain Alan! I'm borrowing this!

18:18.380 --> 18:20.380
Huh? Hey!

18:20.750 --> 18:22.630
Arthur, go!

18:22.880 --> 18:23.630
Right!

18:25.080 --> 18:28.710
Keep your hands off them!

18:31.460 --> 18:32.330
Those guys...

18:32.330 --> 18:33.580
Are they knights?!

18:34.460 --> 18:35.330
Attack!

18:35.750 --> 18:36.750
Sir!

18:42.080 --> 18:43.380
Wake up!

18:43.830 --> 18:46.790
It seems he's just lost consciousness. Don't worry.

18:47.920 --> 18:49.380
I hope Stale is all right.

18:53.670 --> 18:55.170
Sir Arthur! At your feet!

19:00.460 --> 19:03.960
Get rid of your sword! If you don't, I'll kill him!

19:12.290 --> 19:13.380
You fool!

19:16.460 --> 19:17.580
Atta boy.

19:24.630 --> 19:26.830
Not so easy standing up, is it?

19:27.330 --> 19:30.380
No need to bring yourself
to the verge of death, you know.

19:30.580 --> 19:32.630
I don't... mind it.

19:37.250 --> 19:39.540
What don't you mind, you stupid brat?!

19:43.130 --> 19:45.420
If I... can be a wall...

19:47.000 --> 19:48.170
Then...

19:58.000 --> 20:01.040
You swine! What are you doing to my subject?!

20:01.630 --> 20:03.710
Slicing metal chains with a sword?!

20:05.630 --> 20:06.920
That's pure nonsense!

20:30.630 --> 20:31.920
You're wasting your time!

20:32.210 --> 20:35.630
The last boss cheat sword can handle any attack it faces!

20:36.130 --> 20:38.290
You... monster!

20:38.630 --> 20:44.420
Since you have a special ability,
you must be another citizen of Freesia.

20:44.710 --> 20:45.880
This is too bad.

20:46.670 --> 20:49.670
Come at me! Let us die by each other's hand!

20:49.670 --> 20:53.380
I won't kill you. My hands will get dirty.

20:53.580 --> 20:55.290
Oh? Is that so?

20:56.460 --> 21:03.420
The Queen of Freesia, Her Majesty Rosa Royal Ivy,
gave the order to exterminate this organization.

21:06.750 --> 21:09.670
Eradicate him, Captain Alan!

21:10.630 --> 21:12.170
As you command!

21:29.540 --> 21:30.630
Lady Jeanne.

21:41.420 --> 21:42.420
What was that?!

21:42.710 --> 21:45.420
Another bomb? But from who?!

23:28.460 --> 23:34.250
The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:
From Villainess to Savior.

23:35.000 --> 23:38.670
Episode 11: "The Merciless Princess and the Order."

23:35.880 --> 23:40.920
<b>"The Merciless Princess and the Order"</b>
